      "skos:altLabel": [
        "Foundational DPI",
        "DPI-F"
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Foundational Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI-F) is the digital public infrastructure, such as identity, payments and data exchange, upon which the health sector can build. DPI-H is distinct from DPI-F and builds on it."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "DPI-F",
      "skos:scopeNote": "Definition from the DPI-H Reference Architecture glossary (smart-ra, foundational-digital-public-infrastructure), verbatim; it replaces the policy-maker track handout's wording (owner, 2026-11-16). Handout section: Infrastructure and architecture.",
